ledge but the sheer volume of information presented was daunting. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s152\",\"d11\",396,649,\"I keep reflecting on whether I could have approached it differently or managed my time better throughout those early days in the course. There’s a part of me that fears missing out on valuable skills that are essential for pursuing my passion in music. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s153\",\"d11\",649,816,\"I’ve been thinking about other ways to learn audio production that might feel less intense and more manageable, perhaps through self-study or online resources instead.\",\"user\",[105]],[\"s154\",\"d11\",816,829,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s155\",\"d11\",829,1041,\"Assistant: It's completely understandable to feel overwhelmed, especially in a field as intricate as audio production, where the technical aspects can sometimes feel like speaking an entirely different language. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s156\",\"d11\",1041,1303,\"Dropping out after just one week is certainly not a reflection of your passion; rather, it reflects your self-awareness and ability to recognize when something isn’t suiting you at that moment. This can often be a crucial step in defining your learning journey. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s157\",\"d11\",1303,1530,\"Pursuing knowledge through different means, such as self-study or even seeking mentorship from seasoned professionals in a more relaxed setting, can provide you with a tailored experience that better suits your learning style. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s158\",\"d11\",1530,1720,\"It’s commendable that you’re considering alternatives, and by doing so, you’re taking proactive steps to ensure that your education aligns with your personal growth and creative aspirations.\",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s159\",\"d12\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 26–28 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s160\",\"d12\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s161\",\"d12\",105,361,\"Us